From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:10:55 +0000
Subject: feat(text): add system-selectable plain text surface

Add SelectableText (Compose) and SelectableTextView (core DSL) backed by
native KRSelectableTextView on Android, iOS and OHOS, giving the system
selection menu on read-only text. It measures through a lazy-layout-safe
measure policy, takes touches via a native-dispatch RELEASE policy so the
native view gets the gesture, exposes truthful a11y text, and dismisses
the iOS edit menu on detach.

